  "description": "BitNet (bitnet.cpp llama-server) hosting facades. Reads the OpenAI-compatible /v1 surface exposed by bitnet.cpp and registers a keyed IChatClient, health-check, and legacy-max-tokens shim. Contains the BitNet client core (BitNetChatClient/BitNetChatClientFactory/BitNetClientOptions — formerly ANcpLua.Agents.BitNet.Core, merged in 5.0.0). Bundles a Roslyn source generator that auto-wires [assembly: BitNetEndpoint] attributes. BitNet is a local test-double / system-under-test, not an authoritative judge.",
